$* Synthetic ALP-format sample, unrelated to private catalogue data.
INPUT BEGIN
NEW GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES

NEW SCYLINDER
CLFL true
TUFL true
PDIS 0
PDIA SUM PARAM 2 IPARAM 1
PHEI PARAM 3
PAXI -Y
NAPP 0
END

NEW SSPHERE
OBST 0
CLFL true
PDIS 0
PDIA 0.25 TIMES PARAM 2
PAXI P1
NAPP 0
END

NEW LINE
OBST 0
CLFL true
SETP P1 P3
END

NEW LSNOUT
TUFL true
PTDI ( ATTRIB PARA[4 ] + 2 + ATTRIB DESP[1 ] )
PBDI PARAM 5
PTDM SUM PARAM 6 IPARAM 1
PBDM SUM PARAM 7 IPARAM 1
PAAX -Y
POFF 0
NAPP 0
END
END
OLD GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES
LOCK
OLD SCYLINDER 1 OF GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES
LOCK
OLD SSPHERE 1 OF GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES
LOCK
OLD LINE 1 OF GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES
LOCK
OLD LSNOUT 1 OF GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES
LOCK
INPUT END GMSET /DEMO-ALP-SHAPES
INPUT FINISH
